{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42809","headline":"登郡楼书事 · 刘兼","name":"登郡楼书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶奉纶书莅旭川，郡楼嘉致尽依然。\n松欹鸟道云藏寺，月满渔舟水浸天。\n望帝古祠花簇簇，锦城归路草芊芊。\n有时倚槛垂双袂，故国风光似眼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}